            <note corresp="#d666-f4" n="2" xml:id="d666-f4-content">
                <p>The Spanish question was not considered at the Paris meetings of the third
                    session of the General Assembly, but was postponed until May 4, 1949, when the
                    First Committee began discussion of this item.</p>
            </note>
